swift test --filter Integration")))
  (section
    (heading "Implementation Notes")
    (subsection
      (heading "Why SimplePacketBuilder?")
      (para "**Problem:** Full YX implementation uses actors and async/await, making simple test senders complex.")
      (para "**Solution:** Provide synchronous packet-building utilities that:")
      (item "Don't require event loops or actors")
      (item "Can be used in simple command-line programs")
      (item "Enable test pattern: build → send → exit")
      (para "**SDTS Discovery:** This pattern took 3-4 days to discover during SDTS development."))
    (subsection
      (heading "API Compatibility")
